COIP 2014-2023, 30 versions: every applied version's wording is cut from the text layer of the Registro Oficial edition of the Code (Supl. 180, 2014) or of the amending act or ruling (no OCR, no consolidation text); 12 acts and rulings whose gazette edition is image-only (or whose struck words come from one) are NOT applied and are marked in their commits and decisions; coverage ends at 4-I-2023 (later reforms not indexed, stated in decisions); compared on 13-X-2021 with the Ediciones Legales consolidation, 663 of 754 articles agree and every disagreement is classified; test build with corpus.json + all parts: check.py 0 mismatches, --compare identical (2026-10-28).
